[% USE KohaDates %]
[% WRAPPER 'wrapper-staff-tool-plugin.inc' method="config" plugin_title="Telford ERP Integration" %]
    <h1>Telford ERP Integration</h1>
    <form method="post">
        <input type="hidden" name="class" value="[% CLASS %]"/>
        <input type="hidden" name="method" value="[% METHOD %]"/>
        <input type="hidden" name="save" value="1" />

        <h2>Fund &rsaquo; sub cost centre mapping</h2>
        <p>Map each Koha fund to one of the four <code>subcc</code> codes the ERP interface accepts. Funds left unmapped will export as <code>UNMAPPED</code> and need fixing before the file is sent on.</p>
        <div class="page-section">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Fund code</th>
                        <th>Fund name</th>
                        <th>Sub cost centre</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    [% FOREACH fund IN funds %]
                    <tr>
                        <td>[% fund.budget_code | html %]</td>
                        <td>[% fund.budget_name | html %]</td>
                        <td>
                            <select name="fund_subcc_[% fund.budget_code | html %]">
                                <option value="">-- Unmapped --</option>
                                [% FOREACH code IN subcc_codes %]
                                <option value="[% code | html %]" [% IF fund_mappings.item(fund.budget_code) == code %]selected="selected"[% END %]>[% code | html %]</option>
                                [% END %]
                            </select>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    [% END %]
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <!-- /.page-section -->

        <p>The ERP creditor number and voucher date on each exported line come straight from the vendor's "Account number" and the invoice's "Billing date" fields in Koha - there's nothing to configure here for those. See <code>docs/DATA_REQUIREMENTS.md</code> if invoices are being skipped from the export.</p>

        <fieldset class="rows">
            <legend>Delivery</legend>
            <ol>
                <li>
                    <label for="output">Output method:</label>
                    <select name="output" id="output">
                        <option value="file" [% UNLESS output == 'upload' %]selected="selected"[% END %]>Write to local file (output/ inside the plugin)</option>
                        <option value="upload" [% IF output == 'upload' %]selected="selected"[% END %]>Upload via configured (S)FTP server</option>
                    </select>
                </li>
                [% IF available_transports.count %]
                <li>
                    <label for="transport_server">(S)FTP server to transfer to:</label>
                    <select name="transport_server" id="transport_server">
                        <option value="" [% UNLESS transport_server %]selected="selected"[% END %]>-- None --</option>
                        [% FOREACH transport IN available_transports %]
                        <option value="[% transport.file_transport_id %]" [% IF transport.file_transport_id == transport_server %]selected="selected"[% END %]>[% transport.name || transport.host %]</option>
                        [% END %]
                    </select>
                </li>
                [% ELSE %]
                <li>No (S)FTP transports are configured yet (Koha administration &rsaquo; File transports). Local file output will be used regardless of the setting above until one exists.</li>
                [% END %]
            </ol>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="rows">
            <legend>Nightly cron schedule</legend>
            <p>Days of the week the nightly cron should run on. Each run covers everything closed since the last scheduled day, up to yesterday.</p>
            <span class="run-days-inline">
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="0" [% IF transport_days.sunday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Sun</label>
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="1" [% IF transport_days.monday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Mon</label>
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="2" [% IF transport_days.tuesday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Tue</label>
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="3" [% IF transport_days.wednesday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Wed</label>
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="4" [% IF transport_days.thursday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Thu</label>
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="5" [% IF transport_days.friday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Fri</label>
                <label class="inline"><input type="checkbox" name="days" value="6" [% IF transport_days.saturday %]checked="checked"[% END %]/> Sat</label>
            </span>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="action">
            <input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" value="Save configuration" />
            <a class="cancel" href="/cgi-bin/koha/plugins/plugins-home.pl">Cancel</a>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
[% END #/ WRAPPER wrapper-staff-tool-plugin.inc %]
